## Pro Tips
<a id="pro-tips"></a>

- **Adjust Settings Based on Your Connection Type** — Selecting the correct connection type can lead to better optimization results, ensuring that you maximize your Internet speed.
- **Test Performance Regularly** — Use the performance testing feature frequently to see how your settings are impacting your gaming experience.
- **Keep Your Software Updated** — Regularly check for updates to ensure you have the latest enhancements and bug fixes for optimal performance.
- **Close Background Applications** — For the best gaming experience, make sure to close any unnecessary applications that may consume bandwidth.
- **Use Wired Connections When Possible** — If feasible, use a wired connection instead of Wi-Fi to achieve the best speed and stability during gameplay.

## FAQ
<a id="faq"></a>

<details>
<summary>What is Gamethrust?</summary>
GameThrust is an application designed to optimize your Internet connection for online gaming, enhancing speed and stability to improve your overall gaming experience.
</details>

<details>
<summary>Is Gamethrust free, and are all features included?</summary>
Yes, GameThrust is completely free, and all features are included in the current version, providing users with a full feature set without any hidden paywall.
</details>

<details>
<summary>Is this a trial or limited version?</summary>
This is not a trial and not a limited version — it is the complete package with every feature included, free of charge. Nothing is locked and no upgrade is required.
</details>

<details>
<summary>How do I download the latest stable release 2026?</summary>
To download the latest stable release, visit the official GameThrust page where you can find the verified Windows installer available for free.
</details>

<details>
<summary>Does Gamethrust work on Windows 10 and Windows 11?</summary>
GameThrust is compatible with both Windows 10 and Windows 11, ensuring that users on either platform can optimize their Internet connections for gaming.
</details>

<details>
<summary>Can I use Gamethrust offline?</summary>
Gamethrust relies on a network for its core function (e.g. shared files, multiplayer or online streams). The interface and settings work offline, but the primary experience requires an internet connection.
</details>

<details>
<summary>How do I upgrade Gamethrust to the newest release?</summary>
Open the official download page and replace your current build with the latest stable release 2026. Your preferences stay intact when you upgrade to the newest version.
</details>

